WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.554
Wukong and his companions were walking through a forest.

2
00:00:07.555 --> 00:00:11.817
"I'm glad the road goes through this shady forest," said the Tang Monk.

3
00:00:11.818 --> 00:00:14.540
"The sun is very hot this morning."

4
00:00:14.541 --> 00:00:18.609
Wujing nodded. "It's nice to walk in the shade."

5
00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:21.749
Wukong looked around suspiciously.

6
00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:25.815
He knew that forests were often filled with dangers.

7
00:00:25.816 --> 00:00:31.244
Suddenly Bajie fell flat on his face. "Oof!"

8
00:00:31.245 --> 00:00:34.917
He climbed back to his feet and rubbed his nose.

9
00:00:34.918 --> 00:00:36.914
[g@"I'm okay," he said.

10
00:00:36.915 --> 00:00:41.699
"I tripped on a rock."@g]

11
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:46.184
The travelers soon came to a wall running along the road.

12
00:00:46.185 --> 00:00:49.893
[g@Behind the wall they could see the roof of a house.

13
00:00:49.894 --> 00:00:52.565
Up ahead was a gate.@g]

14
00:00:52.566 --> 00:00:57.073
"I wonder who lives here," said Wujing.

15
00:00:57.074 --> 00:01:00.927
"Shh," said Wukong. "I hear laughter."

16
00:01:00.928 --> 00:01:03.497
The monkey peeked over the wall.

17
00:01:03.498 --> 00:01:08.097
Three young women were laughing and kicking a ball around.

18
00:01:08.098 --> 00:01:11.740
"I see three young women," said Wukong.

19
00:01:11.741 --> 00:01:15.207
"Let's ask them for some food," said Wujing.

20
00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:17.839
[g@"That's a good idea," said Bajie.

21
00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:19.633
"I'll go talk to them."@g]

22
00:01:19.634 --> 00:01:22.049
The pig headed toward the gate.

23
00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:25.825
[g@"Bajie, wait here," said the Tang Monk.

24
00:01:25.826 --> 00:01:28.409
He looked at his companions.@g]

25
00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:30.107
[g@"I will speak to the women.

26
00:01:30.108 --> 00:01:32.238
You three might frighten them."@g]

27
00:01:32.239 --> 00:01:35.299
"Frighten them?" Bajie echoed.

28
00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:37.898
[g@"Yes," said the Tang Monk.

29
00:01:37.899 --> 00:01:41.954
"After all, Bajie, you're a large, talking pig.@g]

30
00:01:41.955 --> 00:01:44.780
[g@Wujing, you're big and purple.

31
00:01:44.781 --> 00:01:49.117
And, Wukong, you're scary sometimes."@g]

32
00:01:49.118 --> 00:01:51.434
The monkey shrugged.

33
00:01:51.435 --> 00:01:54.604
Wujing nodded.

34
00:01:54.605 --> 00:02:00.512
"Fine," snapped Bajie.

35
00:02:00.513 --> 00:02:05.002
[g@The Tang Monk opened the gate and went through.

36
00:02:05.003 --> 00:02:08.516
He approached the women.@g]

37
00:02:08.517 --> 00:02:12.940
"Look!" said one woman. "We have a visitor."

38
00:02:12.941 --> 00:02:15.983
"He's a monk," said another woman.

39
00:02:15.984 --> 00:02:19.913
"What can we do for you?" asked the third.

40
00:02:19.914 --> 00:02:22.493
"Hello," said the Tang Monk.

41
00:02:22.494 --> 00:02:28.875
"I'm wondering if you could spare some food for my companions and me."

42
00:02:28.876 --> 00:02:31.759
The three women smiled.

43
00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:35.897
"Of course we can spare some food!" said the first woman.

44
00:02:35.898 --> 00:02:39.630
"We have plenty," said the second woman.

45
00:02:39.631 --> 00:02:42.598
"Come inside our house," said the third.

46
00:02:42.599 --> 00:02:48.941
The three young women led the Tang Monk into their house.

47
00:02:48.942 --> 00:02:53.218
As soon as the monk entered, he became scared.

48
00:02:53.219 --> 00:02:57.481
The interior of the house was dark and dreary.

49
00:02:57.482 --> 00:03:02.348
Dust covered everything, and cobwebs hung from the walls.

50
00:03:02.349 --> 00:03:05.094
"Tell us, monk," said one woman.

51
00:03:05.095 --> 00:03:08.612
"Why are you walking through our forest today?"

52
00:03:08.613 --> 00:03:11.942
The Tang Monk looked around nervously.

53
00:03:11.943 --> 00:03:17.596
"I, um . . . I'm going to the Western Paradise to—"

54
00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:22.111
"You're the Tang Monk!" shrieked all three women.

55
00:03:22.112 --> 00:03:24.638
[g@The Tang Monk took a step back.

56
00:03:24.639 --> 00:03:27.610
"You've . . . heard of me?"@g]

57
00:03:27.611 --> 00:03:30.233
"Of course," said one woman.

58
00:03:30.234 --> 00:03:33.554
All three women reached behind their heads.

59
00:03:33.555 --> 00:03:38.467
They began to pull out long strands of spider silk.

60
00:03:38.468 --> 00:03:46.022
Swiftly they moved toward the Tang Monk.

61
00:03:46.023 --> 00:03:50.989
"What's taking Master so long?" asked Wukong.

62
00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:55.077
The monk's companions were waiting outside in the road.

63
00:03:55.078 --> 00:04:00.630
"He's probably inside that house, enjoying a nice meal," said Bajie.

64
00:04:00.631 --> 00:04:04.978
"Meanwhile, we're out here, starving."

65
00:04:04.979 --> 00:04:09.524
"The Tang Monk wouldn't do that, Bajie," said Wujing.

66
00:04:09.525 --> 00:04:11.344
[g@Wukong looked worried.

67
00:04:11.345 --> 00:04:14.504
"We'd better check on Master."@g]

68
00:04:14.505 --> 00:04:18.481
[g@"If there's food, I want to be there," said Bajie.

69
00:04:18.482 --> 00:04:20.512
"I'll go with you."@g]

70
00:04:20.513 --> 00:04:23.460
[g@The two of them went to the gate.

71
00:04:23.461 --> 00:04:30.196
When they saw the house, they both gasped.@g]

72
00:04:30.197 --> 00:04:35.381
"The house is covered in spiderwebs!" cried the pig.

73
00:04:35.382 --> 00:04:39.989
Wukong kicked in the gate, and they rushed toward the house.

74
00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:43.762
The monkey banged on the door. "Open up!"

75
00:04:43.763 --> 00:04:45.904
The door flew open.

76
00:04:45.905 --> 00:04:51.600
The three women leaped out, shooting sticky webs at Wukong and Bajie.

77
00:04:51.601 --> 00:04:54.390
The pig waved his rake.

78
00:04:54.391 --> 00:05:01.362
Webs wrapped around it, and soon the weapon was stuck to his head.

79
00:05:01.363 --> 00:05:06.084
Bajie turned to run, but more webs flew toward him.

80
00:05:06.085 --> 00:05:15.857
They wrapped around his legs, and he fell to the ground.

